Z||000006||lowCG||04-01-2000||05:40 PM||||Yeah,I wouldn't want to have to do it in the car in just a couple years,when I could start out fresh.The belt covers on this thing have a leather grained texture on them,funky,but I like it!I'm now engineering an idler pulley for the serpentine belt to go in place of the PS pump.Could just leave it disabled,but would rather get rid of it if I can.Still have to go back to the boneyard and get my airflow meter,the older cars with this motor never used one,but this one does('97).||||reg||1
